110:## The page
111-
112-`app.js` holds the current answer from the server and the score (X wins, O
113-wins, draws, until the page is reloaded). Each click or Enter/Space on a
114-square sends one move. The board is one tab stop: arrow keys, Home and End
115-move between squares (roving `tabindex`), and every square has an
116-`aria-label` such as "Row 1, column 3, X, winning". The status line is an
117-`aria-live` region. Changing mode or level starts a new game.
118-
119-## Tests
120-
121-- `tests/test_game.py`, `tests/test_ai.py`, `tests/test_server.py`: unit
122-  tests. `test_hard_never_loses` plays Hard against every possible opponent,
123-  as X and as O.
124-- `tests/system/test_http.py`: starts `python3 -m tictactoe --port 0` as a
125-  process and tests it over HTTP: health, assets, 404s, whole games, errors.

